    "type": "game",
    "name": "Wacky West",
    "steam_appid": 2582470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "Wacky West is a high-octane, post-apocalyptic survival game set in the scorched Arizona desert after a nuclear catastrophe. Play as a resourceful survivalist battling hordes of mutants and zombies while scavenging the wasteland to upgrade your underground hideout and craft powerful weapons. In this action-packed, wild-west themed world, every run is a fight for survival as you dodge hazards, face menacing bosses, and gather crucial materials.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Wild Weapon Crafting: Create and upgrade an arsenal of unique weapons, from auto-targeting machine guns to rocket launchers and flamethrowers.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Wasteland Scavenging: Collect junk, scrap, and salvageable materials to craft tools, build weapons, and upgrade your base.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Epic Boss Battles: Encounter chaotic bosses like grenade-launching mutants and rocket-firing barricades that will test your survival skills.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hazards &amp; Perks: Navigate dangerous traps like barbed wire and corrosive puddles while grabbing useful pickups like Scrap Packs and Adrenaline Shots for an extra boost.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Endless Mode: After defeating the final boss, choose to continue the madness in endless mode for greater challenges and double the rewards.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Progressive Upgrades: Improve your gear and unlock new weapons and add-ons as you progress through multiple runs using the resources you\u2019ve collected. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique Combat System: Smash loot crates with your melee attack to claim powerful items and engage in the one-of-three loot system after each boss for valuable upgrades.</li></ul><br>In Wacky West, it\u2019s all about crafting, scavenging, and surviving the wildest apocalypse imaginable!",
    "about_the_game": "Wacky West is a high-octane, post-apocalyptic survival game set in the scorched Arizona desert after a nuclear catastrophe. Play as a resourceful survivalist battling hordes of mutants and zombies while scavenging the wasteland to upgrade your underground hideout and craft powerful weapons. In this action-packed, wild-west themed world, every run is a fight for survival as you dodge hazards, face menacing bosses, and gather crucial materials.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Wild Weapon Crafting: Create and upgrade an arsenal of unique weapons, from auto-targeting machine guns to rocket launchers and flamethrowers.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Wasteland Scavenging: Collect junk, scrap, and salvageable materials to craft tools, build weapons, and upgrade your base.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Epic Boss Battles: Encounter chaotic bosses like grenade-launching mutants and rocket-firing barricades that will test your survival skills.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hazards &amp; Perks: Navigate dangerous traps like barbed wire and corrosive puddles while grabbing useful pickups like Scrap Packs and Adrenaline Shots for an extra boost.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Endless Mode: After defeating the final boss, choose to continue the madness in endless mode for greater challenges and double the rewards.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Progressive Upgrades: Improve your gear and unlock new weapons and add-ons as you progress through multiple runs using the resources you\u2019ve collected. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique Combat System: Smash loot crates with your melee attack to claim powerful items and engage in the one-of-three loot system after each boss for valuable upgrades.</li></ul><br>In Wacky West, it\u2019s all about crafting, scavenging, and surviving the wildest apocalypse imaginable!",
    "short_description": "Wacky West brings the action you\u2019ve always wanted from those endless runner fake mobile ads, but this time it\u2019s the real thing! Dive into a fast-paced, post-apocalyptic world, fight off mutants, create sick combo builds, craft weapons, and survive the wasteland.",
